Mechanism and acceptance:
- crates/bbt-ui-model/src/input/focus.rs:65 — row/pane activation updates existing
  Stage without opening/shutting swarms; emits opposite-view Locate even on a
  repeated activation; explicit activation clears any new unread notification.
- focus.rs:91 — a cross-stage Locate waits for layout_ready to find that target;
  repeated activations do not bypass the pending layout; it fires once, and
  daemon close cancels stale intent. Invalid targets leave model/intent intact.
- focus.rs:129 — forward/reverse cycling uses split-tree leaves, independent of
  sidebar insertion order; directional navigation uses lab edge eligibility and
  along+2*across scoring with tree-order ties, restricted to the current tab.
- focus.rs:203 — pointer hits use supplied pane rects; layout movement re-hits
  the pointer. Pane dwell needs 150 ms, keys guard strictly until more than 1 s,
  blocked dwell waits for re-entry, and dwell never emits Locate.
- crates/bbt-ui-model/src/input/keys.rs:49 — terminal plain/control/alt keys stay
  Terminal; Cmd+Opt arrows and Tab/ShiftTab route to pane navigation. Plain
  chrome navigation is allowed; fields, launcher and overlay keep local keys.
  This router is called after global shortcuts and never encodes PTY bytes.
- crates/bbt-ui-model/src/model/window.rs:234 and src/lib.rs:8 — expose the
  existing internal focus operation and input module; no new dependencies,
  event variants, draw changes or app edits.
- crates/bbt-ui-model/tests/input.rs:88 — 15 synthetic tests cover these paths.

